IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDIST-INTERCONNECT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 GPUS-PER-NODE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-NODES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 INTERCONNECT-LINKS  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 EFFICIENCY-PCT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDIST.
    IF GPUS-PER-NODE == 0
        MOVE 8 TO GPUS-PER-NODE.
    END-IF.

    IF TOTAL-NODES == 0
        MOVE 4 TO TOTAL-NODES.
    END-IF.

    MOVE GPUS-PER-NODE TO INTERCONNECT-LINKS.
    MULTIPLY TOTAL-NODES BY INTERCONNECT-LINKS.
    MOVE 92 TO EFFICIENCY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 INTERCONNECT-LINKS.
    WEIGHT 30 EFFICIENCY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
